Welcome to Zohara OS.

Get started:
  zohara-welcome          - first-run onboarding (also auto-launches on the desktop)
  sudo calamares          - launch the graphical installer
  zohara-settings         - open the Zohara Settings app
  zohara-store            - open the Zohara Software Store
  zohara-settings --page Accounts - manage user accounts

Help and docs:
  https://github.com/Zohaib8090/zohara

Network:
  iwctl                   - connect to Wi-Fi
  nmcli                   - manage NetworkManager connections
  Ethernet and DHCP work automatically.
